abstract = {It has been an honor and a pleasure to serve as program chairs for the 2026 ACM Secure Development Conference (SecDev’26). We are looking forward to meeting with the SecDev community in person in Montreal, Canada, where SecDev will be co-located with the ACM International Conference on the Foundations of Software Engineering (FSE).},
